; Types and rules, pure except Ids.fresh, which reads the wall clock and a
; self-seeded RNG for UUID v7. No Brr: builds natively for tests. yojson for
; the to_json/of_json column codecs of ids and closed value sets, and for the
; reference payload (its type and its structural equality).
(library
 (name herbier_domain)
 (public_name herbier.domain)
 (libraries ptime ptime.clock.os uuidm yojson)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_deriving.eq ppx_deriving.show)))

